(footprint "JUSHUO_AFA07-S15ECA-00_1x15-1MP_P1.0mm_Horizontal"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "kicad-footprint-generator")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "JUSHUO AFA07-S15ECA-00, 15-way 1.0mm-pitch FFC/FPC ZIF connector, right angle, slide lock, 2.5mm height, SMT. UPPER (top) contacts: the contacts are on the side of the slot AWAY from the PCB, so the cable must be inserted with its exposed copper facing UP, away from this board. This is the mirror-image variant of the stock Connector_FFC-FPC:JUSHUO_AFA07-S15FCA-00... footprint, whose part has LOWER (bottom) contacts. Per the JUSHUO series drawing the part number decodes as AFA07-S<ckts><plating><contacts>-A-00 with CONTACTS TYPE E:Upper, F:Lower. Both variants share one recommended PCB pattern layout (pitch 1.00, pads 0.60x1.80, mounting nails 2.60x3.00, circuit 1 to nail outer edge 3.65, overall 4.57), verified against both datasheets, so the copper here is identical to the FCA footprint and only the mated cable orientation differs. LCSC C262742. https://www.lcsc.com/datasheet/lcsc_datasheet_2304140030_JUSHUO-AFA07-S15ECA-00_C262742.pdf")
	(tags "jushuo fpc ffc zif upper contact top contact")
